{"sourceUrl":"https://gcxy.scau.edu.cn/2025/0624/c2105a412438/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:14.982162+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://gcxy.scau.edu.cn/2025/0624/c2105a412438/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span><span><span><span>华南农业大学是全国重点大学，国家“双一流”建设高校，广东省高水平大学建设高校。工程学院拥有农业工程一级学科、机械工程一级学科和智慧农业交叉学科群</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>其中</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>农业工程一级学科为广东省攀峰重点学科，农业机械化工程二级学科为国家重点（培育）学科。学院招收农业工程、机械工程学术型硕士研究生，以及农机装备工程、机器人工程、机械工程、控制工程和农业工程与信息技术专业学位硕士研究生。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>为了促进全国大学生之间的交流，增进优秀大学生对工程学院相关学科的全面了解和研究兴趣，吸引有科研热情和培养潜质的学生继续深造，我院定于</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月线下举办第二届优秀大学生夏令营活动，现将有关事项通知如下。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>一、夏令营安排</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>1.“</span></span><span><span><span><span>华南农业大学工程学院</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营”活动将于</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>日至</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>日在广州举行。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>本次计划招生人数</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>30</span></span><span><span><span><span>人，即日起开始报名，报名截止时间为</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>29</span></span><span><span><span><span>日，逾期不再接受申请。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>夏令营期间，将开展开营仪式、学校和学院介绍、实验室参观、名家讲座、师生交流、实践基地参观、优秀大学生风采展示等系列活动。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span><span><span>学院将给参加夏令营并完成相关活动的营员颁发结营证书。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>二、申请条件</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱社会主义祖国，对科学研究有浓厚兴趣，遵纪守法，品行端正，身心健康；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>全国高校</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>届农业机械化及其自动化、机械设计制造及其自动化、自动化、机器人工程、车辆工程、能源与环境系统工程等相关专业的本科应届毕业生；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>学习成绩优秀，本科前</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2.5</span></span><span><span><span><span>学年学习成绩绩点排名前</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>40%</span></span><span><span><span><span>，且平均分在</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>80</span></span><span><span><span><span>分以上，所有课程成绩均为及格及以上；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span><span><span>具有较强的英语能力，英语四级成绩在</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>425</span></span><span><span><span><span>分及以上，通过英语六级（≥</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>425</span></span><span><span><span><span>分）者优先；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span><span><span>对科研能力突出或有特殊培养潜质的申请者成绩标准可适当放宽。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>三、营员奖惠政策</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>夏令营期间，学院为营员购买保险，统一安排营员就餐；广州市外高校学生在营期间住宿由学院统一安排；广州市高校学生不安排住宿，每人每天补助交通费</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>50</span></span><span><span><span><span>元；本校学生不安排住宿不补助交通费；广州市外高校学生报销车票（从学校或家庭所在地往返广州的车票，含汽车、普通硬卧车票、或动车高铁二等座车票），报销总额度不超过</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1000</span></span><span><span><span><span>元，不予报销飞机票。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>参加夏令营学生通过推免被我院录取后，入学可获得</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>10000</span></span><span><span><span><span>元特别学业奖学金。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>四、申请材料</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>请在报名截至日期前将以下电子版材料压缩打包发至邮箱</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>gcxyyjs@scau.edu.cn</span></span><span><span><span><span>。文件夹、邮件标题为：所在学校全称</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span><span><span>本人姓名</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>-2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年夏令营申请。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.《华南农业大学工程学院2025年夏令营申请表》（附件1）（签字、盖章扫描件）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.《华南农业大学工程学院2025年夏令营报名信息汇总表》（附件2）（电子版）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩证明：前</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2.5</span></span><span><span><span><span>学年的学习成绩单原件和绩点排名证明（需加盖申请人所在学校教务部门的学习成绩专用章，扫描件）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span><span><span>英语水平证明：国家英语四、六级考试成绩或</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>TOEFL/GRE/GMAT/</span></span><span><span><span><span>雅思等成绩（扫描件）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span><span><span>身份证（正反面）、学生证（照片页和信息页）（扫描件）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span><span><span>已发表论文和获奖经历证明：本科在读期间发表论文、各类获奖情况，按照学业科研获奖、德育获奖和文体获奖分类建立文件夹（扫描件）。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>五、注意事项</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>参加夏令营的学生必须遵守华南农业大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排全程参加夏令营各项活动，如发现违规者，取消营员资格。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>活动具体安排如有调整，届时将及时通知入选营员。欢迎加入【</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年华南农业大学工程学院夏令营】</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>QQ</span></span><span><span><span><span>交流群，群号：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>680292033</span></span><span><span><span><span>。（请以“所在学校</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span><span><span>姓名</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>+2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年夏令营”申请进群）。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>凡发现申请材料有虚假成分，我院将取消申请人一切由此获得的利益，并通报考生所在学校主管部门。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span><span><span>其他未尽事宜由华南农业大学工程学院负责解释。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>六、联系方式</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>联系人：李老师、黄老师</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>020-85280898</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>gcxyyjs@scau.edu.cn</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>通讯地址：广东省广州市天河区五山路</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>483</span></span><span><span><span><span>号华南农业大学</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>工程学院官网：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>https://gcxy.scau.edu.cn/</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>学院官微：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>SCAU</span></span><span><span><span><span>工程学院</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p>           <img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://gcxy.scau.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://gcxy.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/07/cb/9aea1ba84605a3be5a5527777ab3/b5a03935-0ec0-45b7-a3ea-b7e3ea417ce6.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"附件1：华南农业大学工程学院2025年夏令营申请表.docx\">附件1：华南农业大学工程学院2025年夏令营申请表.docx</a></p><p>           </p><p>            <img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://gcxy.scau.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_xls.gif\"/><a href=\"https://gcxy.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/07/cb/9aea1ba84605a3be5a5527777ab3/a1761167-64b4-4469-811f-8b3f2bd72591.xlsx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"附件2：华南农业大学工程学院2025年夏令营申请信息汇总表.xlsx\">附件2：华南农业大学工程学院2025年夏令营申请信息汇总表.xlsx</a></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"c0214736ff198006bf3cf4f074414e5d0790dd8acb8ae6ed44fdc9c1060bf534","textLength":1734,"sourceSha256":"21d48a02777b06467ec716e8e9037791401243c6e72126e8aebd9219990e2378","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d05afd7863531fcc65cb","title":"2025年华南农业大学工程学院关于举办2025年优秀大学生夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:14.982162+00:00"}
